  "name": "Staff of the Savants",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Requires attunement.</em></p><p>When you attune to this staff, choose two schools of magic to favour and two other schools to disfavour. You gain a +1 bonus to spell attack rolls and to the spell save DC of spells from the favoured schools, and a −1 penalty to those of spells from the disfavoured schools.</p><p>When you finish a Long Rest, you can change your choices.</p><p>The staff is an Arcane Focus.</p>",
